# Agent branch vs base deliverables

After SUCCESS:
- Commit full trail on `agent/task-*` (product + `.agent/` + `.aider.chat.history.md`)
- Auto-promote **only** deliverables onto the start/base branch (`--keep-tests` includes acceptance)
- Leave HEAD on the base branch — no manual merge or branch browsing
- Keep `agent/task-*` for audit; do not delete it automatically
